Package: mirrormate
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10)
Maintainer: MirrorMate contributors <alisharifyofficial@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/free-programmers/MirrorMate
Description: Safe package repository mirror switcher
 MirrorMate provides a shared CLI and curses TUI for benchmarking and
 configuring APT, PyPI, NPM, Go, and Docker repository mirrors.
